  "conclusions": [
    "All ten full-sheet captures (3,983,184 pixels each) take18.231–31.155ms, exceeding first-bend16.667ms before a drawable is rendered. capture(sheet) uses UIKit drawHierarchy(afterScreenUpdates:true); phase does not separate snapshot rendering, flush, conversion or allocation.",
