    "Controller holds bending until the first actual flat receipt, rebases animation.start to that receipt, and advances only on the next Metal display callback. This serial barrier corresponds to25.010–33.347ms primer-to-first-bend intervals. It is a safety rule, not evidence that it can simply be removed.",
    "All378 recorded GPU completions are at least4.262ms before their assigned target, and CA commits at least9.930ms early. Underlay/present/CA callback wall work is tens of microseconds, not the dominant observed startup/cadence delay.",
